\pard\b\fs28 Sing A New Song Unto the Lord\b0\fs22\par
\par
[Chorus]\par
Sing a new song unto the Lord;\par
Let your song be sung from mountains high\par
Sing a new song unto the Lord\par
Singing alleluia\par
\par
[Verse 1]\par
Yahweh's people dance for joy\par
O come before the Lord\par
And play for him on glad tambourines\par
And let your trumpet sound\par
\par
[Chorus]\par
Sing a new song unto the Lord;\par
Let your song be sung from mountains high\par
Sing a new song unto the Lord\par
Singing alleluia\par
\par
[Verse 2]\par
Rise, O children, from your sleep;\par
Your Savior now has come\par
He has turned your sorrow to joy\par
And filled your soul with song\par
\par
[Chorus]\par
Sing a new song unto the Lord;\par
Let your song be sung from mountains high\par
Sing a new song unto the Lord\par
Singing alleluia\par
